msgid "%s and %s would both go to %s. Their names differ only in case, which a provider that ignores case treats as one name. Move them separately."
msgstr "%s 和 %s 都会放到 %s。它们的名称只有大小写不同，不区分大小写的服务商会把它们视为同一个名称。请分开移动。"

#: core/operations/flags.go
